# Orzhov Basilica's "return a land you control to its owner's hand" is not optional and the land itself may be the one: played as
# Bot1's first land (CR 603.6a, the trigger is put on the stack after it enters), it has no other land to return and goes back
# to the hand, and the land drop of the turn is used. Played again on turn 3, it can then be kept: the Plains played in
# between returns.

[Bot1 Deck]
Orzhov Basilica
Plains
Plains x5
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Orzhov Basilica.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
? Bot1.LandsPlayed = 1
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Orzhov Basilica.Play
Bot1.Choose(Plains)

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield = Orzhov Basilica
Bot1.Battlefield.Orzhov Basilica.Tapped = true
